    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0721" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1941v02/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.248/142</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of the Navy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Knox</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-03-29">March 29, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>For your information, I quote the following message which I received from the
                    President today: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Authorized cancellation previous allocation 30 Grumman planes to British
                            and transfer these planes to Greece.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frank Knox</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
